<view class="page"><view class="safe-top"></view><view class="topbar"><view class="back" bindtap="back"><image class="figma-back" src="/assets/figma/all/s23-imgFrame.svg"/></view><view class="top-title-main top-title">发布经历</view><view class="top-action" bindtap="save">保存草稿</view><view class="publish-small" bindtap="publish">发</view></view><view class="primary-btn" style="height:104rpx">请分享亲身经历，不发布诊断或治疗结论</view>
<view class="section-title"><text>经历标签</text><text class="aside">必填</text></view><view class="stack gap-8"><view class="field" bindtap="selectRegion"><text class="field-label">地区</text><text class="field-value">{{region}}</text><image class="figma-icon sm" src="/assets/figma/all/s02-imgFrame2.svg"/></view><view class="field" bindtap="selectType"><text class="field-label">接触类型</text><text class="field-value">{{type}}</text><image class="figma-icon sm" src="/assets/figma/all/s02-imgFrame2.svg"/></view><view class="field" bindtap="selectStage"><text class="field-label">经历阶段</text><text class="field-value">{{stage}}</text><image class="figma-icon sm" src="/assets/figma/all/s02-imgFrame2.svg"/></view></view>
<view class="section-title"><text>经历内容</text><text class="aside">至少 20 字</text></view><view class="textarea-wrap"><view class="content-hint" wx:if="{{!text}}"><text>按“场景—处理—变化”来写，会更有参考价值</text><text>场景：在哪里、什么活动？</text><text>处理：当时做了什么？</text><text>变化：之后怎样、是否复查？</text></view><textarea class="post-textarea" value="{{text}}" bindinput="input" maxlength="1000"/></view>
<view class="section-title"><text>图片与关联</text><text class="aside">选填</text></view><view class="row gap-12"><view class="photo-add" bindtap="image"><text class="photo-plus">＋</text><view class="tiny">添加图片</view></view><view class="card card-pad row grow"><view class="circle circle-green" style="width:64rpx;height:64rpx"><image class="figma-icon sm" src="/assets/figma/all/s23-img2.svg"/></view><view class="grow" style="margin-left:20rpx"><view>关联事件</view><view class="tiny">蚊虫叮咬 · 今天</view></view><text class="event-selected">已选</text></view></view><view class="card card-pad row" style="margin-top:28rpx" bindtap="planRoute"><view class="circle circle-green" style="width:64rpx;height:64rpx"><image class="figma-icon sm" src="/assets/figma/all/s23-imgVector.svg"/></view><view class="grow" style="margin-left:20rpx"><view>关联丽水徒步路线</view><view class="tiny">公开完整轨迹</view></view><switch color="#2f875f" checked="{{route}}" bindchange="toggle" catchtap="noop"/></view><view class="safe-note" style="margin-top:24rpx">完整路线将向本帖读者公开精确轨迹</view></view>
